<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Local LLM Hardware Advisor Report</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-bg: #0f172a;
      --color-surface: #1e293b;
      --color-surface-hover: #334155;
      --color-border: #334155;
      --color-text: #f8fafc;
      --color-muted: #94a3b8;
      --color-accent: #38bdf8;
      --color-success: #22c55e;
      --color-warning: #eab308;
      --color-danger: #ef4444;
      --color-info: #6366f1;
      --radius-sm: 6px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--color-bg);
      color: var(--color-text);
      font-family: var(--font-family);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.8), rgba(15,23,42,0.9));
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    header p {
      color: var(--color-muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .grid-metrics {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .metric-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.25rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .metric-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .metric-label {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .metric-value {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .metric-sub {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin: 2.5rem 0 1.25rem 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .section-title::after {
      content: '';
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--color-border);
    }

    .assessment-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(234,179,8,0.1), rgba(30,41,59,0.8));
      border: 1px solid var(--color-warning);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .badge-success { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.2); color: var(--color-success); border: 1px solid var(--color-success); }
    .badge-warning { background: rgba(234,179,8,0.2); color: var(--color-warning); border: 1px solid var(--color-warning); }
    .badge-danger { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.2); color: var(--color-danger); border: 1px solid var(--color-danger); }

    .card-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .recommendation-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .rec-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .rec-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text); }
    .rec-score { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-accent); }

    .rec-meta { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }

    .bullet-list { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .bullet-list li { font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; position: relative; }
    .bullet-list li::before { content: '•'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--color-accent); }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    th { background: rgba(51,65,85,0.5); color: var(--color-muted); font-weight: 600; }

    /* Purpose Tabs */
    .tabs { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tab-btn {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      color: var(--color-text);
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .tab-btn.active, .tab-btn:hover {
      background: var(--color-accent);
      color: #000;
    }
    .tab-content { display: none; }
    .tab-content.active { display: block; }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--color-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-top: 4rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Local LLM Hardware Advisor</h1>
      <p>Data-backed local machine analysis and explainable model recommendations</p>
    </header>

    <h2 class="section-title">Hardware Profile</h2>
    <div class="grid-metrics">
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Operating System</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ report.hardware.os_info.platform_name }}</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">{{ report.hardware.os_info.release }} ({{ report.hardware.os_info.architecture }})</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">CPU</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ report.hardware.cpu.brand }}</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">{{ report.hardware.cpu.physical_cores }} cores / {{ report.hardware.cpu.logical_cores }} threads</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">System RAM</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ "%.1f"|format(report.hardware.memory.total_gb) }} GB</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">Safe Budget: {{ "%.1f"|format(report.hardware.memory.safe_budget_gb) }} GB</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">GPU Acceleration</div>
        <div class="metric-value">
          {% if report.hardware.gpus %}
            {{ report.hardware.gpus[0].vendor.value }}
          {% else %}
            CPU Only
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="metric-sub">
          {% if report.hardware.gpus %}
            {{ "%.1f"|format(report.hardware.gpus[0].vram_gb) }} GB VRAM
          {% else %}
            No dedicated VRAM
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-label">Storage</div>
        <div class="metric-value">{{ "%.1f"|format(report.hardware.storage.free_gb) }} GB Free</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">{{ report.hardware.storage.storage_type.value }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="assessment-box">
      <span class="badge badge-warning">{{ report.overall_rating_badge }}</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:0.75rem; font-size:1.3rem;">Machine Assessment</h3>
      <p style="margin-top:0.4rem; color:var(--color-text);">{{ report.overall_rating_text }}</p>
      <p style="margin-top:0.4rem; font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-muted);">
        <strong>Primary Bottleneck:</strong> {{ report.primary_bottleneck }} | 
        <strong>Recommended Model Class:</strong> {{ report.recommended_model_size_class }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Top Recommendations</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for rec in report.top_recommendations %}
      <div class="recommendation-card">
        <div>
          <div class="rec-header">
            <div class="rec-title">#{{ rec.rank }} {{ rec.model.name }}</div>
            <div class="rec-score">{{ rec.score }}/100</div>
          </div>
          <div class="rec-meta">
            Quant: <strong>{{ rec.recommended_quantization.value }}</strong> | 
            Fit: <span class="badge badge-success">{{ rec.compatibility.level.value }}</span>
          </div>

          <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Why Recommended:</div>
          <ul class="bullet-list">
            {% for why in rec.why_recommended %}
              <li>{{ why }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>

          <div style="font-weight:600; font-size:0.9rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Best For:</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--color-accent); margin-bottom:1rem;">
            {{ rec.best_for | join(', ') }}
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--color-muted); border-top:1px solid var(--color-border); padding-top:0.75rem;">
          Suggested Runtime: <strong>{{ rec.suggested_runtime }}</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Recommendations by Purpose</h2>
    <div class="tabs">
      {% for purpose_name, recs in report.by_purpose.items() %}
        <button class="tab-btn {% if loop.first %}active{% endif %}" onclick="openTab(event, 'tab-{{ loop.index }}')">
          {{ purpose_name }}
        </button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% for purpose_name, recs in report.by_purpose.items() %}
    <div id="tab-{{ loop.index }}" class="tab-content {% if loop.first %}active{% endif %}">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Model</th>
            <th>Quantization</th>
            <th>Compatibility</th>
            <th>Score</th>
            <th>Suggested Context</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for rec in recs %}
          <tr>
            <td><strong>{{ rec.model.name }}</strong></td>
            <td>{{ rec.recommended_quantization.value }}</td>
            <td>{{ rec.compatibility.level.badge_emoji }} {{ rec.compatibility.level.value }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ rec.score }}</strong></td>
            <td>{{ rec.suggested_context_range }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}

    <h2 class="section-title">Quantization & Context Guide</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="metric-card">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem; color:var(--color-accent);">Quantization Tradeoffs</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-muted);">
          Lower quantization (e.g. Q4_K_M) reduces RAM requirement by ~50% with minimal loss in perplexity quality (~97% quality retention). Q8_0 offers pristine fidelity but requires double the memory.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem; color:var(--color-accent);">Context Window Overhead</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-muted);">
          Context length isn't free: KV cache memory scales linearly with context length. Running 32K–128K context requires significant extra VRAM/RAM overhead beyond base model weights.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Methodology & Explainability</h2>
    <div class="assessment-box" style="background:var(--color-surface); border-color:var(--color-border);">
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem; color:var(--color-accent);">Scoring Matrix & Mathematical Methodology</h3>
      <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-muted); margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
        Recommendations are evaluated through a deterministic 5-factor scoring model (0–100 scale):
      </p>
      <ul class="bullet-list" style="color:var(--color-text);">
        <li><strong>Hardware Fit (30%):</strong> Evaluates VRAM vs safe RAM headroom and hardware acceleration availability.</li>
        <li><strong>Memory Headroom (20%):</strong> Ensures remaining RAM/VRAM capacity prevents OS swap thrashing.</li>
        <li><strong>Expected Speed (20%):</strong> Classifies latency tier based on GPU compute vs CPU core offloading.</li>
        <li><strong>Model Quality (20%):</strong> Factors benchmark intelligence tiers (SOTA frontier vs small task models).</li>
        <li><strong>Context Support (10%):</strong> Calculates KV cache memory overhead at target context lengths.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>Generated by Local LLM Hardware Advisor • Clean, offline, explainable hardware compatibility engine.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    function openTab(evt, tabId) {
      const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content');
      contents.forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));

      const btns = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
      btns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));

      document.getElementById(tabId).classList.add('active');
      evt.currentTarget.classList.add('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
